  "solution": "**Given :-**\n\n6 (1)/(2) times 2 (4)/(5) div x=(7)/(10)\n\n**Concept use :-**\n\nBODMAS\n\n**Calculation :-**\n\n6 (1)/(2) times 2 (4)/(5) div x=(7)/(10)\n\n⇒ (13)/(2)times(14)/(5)div x = (7)/(10)\n\n⇒ (13)/(2)times(frac{14)/(5)}{x}= (7)/(10)\n\n⇒(13)/(2)times(14)/(5)times(1)/(x)= (7)/(10)\n\n⇒ x = **26**",
